# Twitter Analytics and Monitoring

Lux provides transport-neutral Twitter/X analytics helpers for engagement
metrics, follower growth, hashtag performance, sentiment rollups, alerts, and
report generation.

## Engagement Metrics

```elixir
alias Lux.Integrations.Twitter.Analytics

tweet = %{
  id: "1",
  text: "Shipping #Elixir",
  like_count: 10,
  reply_count: 2,
  retweet_count: 3,
  quote_count: 1,
  bookmark_count: 4,
  impression_count: 100
}

Analytics.engagement_metrics(tweet)
```

## Aggregation

```elixir
Analytics.aggregate_engagement([tweet])
```

The aggregate includes total engagement counts, average engagement rate, and
top tweets by total engagements.

## Follower Growth

```elixir
Analytics.follower_growth([
  %{captured_at: "2026-05-12T00:00:00Z", follower_count: 1_000},
  %{captured_at: "2026-05-13T00:00:00Z", follower_count: 1_250}
])
```

## Hashtag Performance

```elixir
Analytics.hashtag_performance([
  %{text: "Shipping #Elixir", like_count: 10, impression_count: 100}
])
```

## Sentiment Rollups

```elixir
Analytics.sentiment_rollup([
  %{sentiment: :positive},
  %{sentiment_score: -0.4}
])
```

## Alerts

```elixir
Analytics.evaluate_alerts(
  %{total_engagements: 500, negative_ratio: 0.2},
  [
    %{metric: :total_engagements, operator: :>=, threshold: 250, severity: :info},
    %{metric: :negative_ratio, operator: :>, threshold: 0.5, severity: :warning}
  ]
)
```

## Reports

```elixir
Analytics.report(
  %{
    account: "@lux",
    tweets: [tweet],
    mentions: [%{sentiment: :positive}],
    follower_snapshots: [
      %{captured_at: "2026-05-12T00:00:00Z", follower_count: 1_000},
      %{captured_at: "2026-05-13T00:00:00Z", follower_count: 1_250}
    ]
  },
  %{
    alert_rules: [
      %{metric: :total_engagements, operator: :>=, threshold: 100}
    ]
  }
)
```

Feed the report into a lens, scheduled beam, or notification prism to build
real-time monitoring and automated reporting workflows.
